*> Harness-only EXEC CICS READ DATASET(ACCTDAT): keyed lookup over the
*> ASCII seed file $ACCTFILE (RESP NORMAL=0, NOTFND=13).
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTREAD.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT ACCT-FILE ASSIGN TO DYNAMIC WS-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD ACCT-FILE.
01 ACCT-REC PIC X(300).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PATH PIC X(256).
01 WS-EOF PIC X.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-KEY PIC X(11).
01 L-RECORD PIC X(300).
01 L-RESP PIC S9(9) BINARY.
01 L-RESP2 PIC S9(9) BINARY.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-KEY L-RECORD L-RESP L-RESP2.
    ACCEPT WS-PATH FROM ENVIRONMENT 'ACCTFILE'
    MOVE 13 TO L-RESP
    MOVE 80 TO L-RESP2
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    OPEN INPUT ACCT-FILE
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
       READ ACCT-FILE
          AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
          NOT AT END
             IF ACCT-REC(1:11) = L-KEY
                MOVE ACCT-REC TO L-RECORD
                MOVE 0 TO L-RESP L-RESP2
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
             END-IF
       END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE ACCT-FILE
    GOBACK.
